+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/periods/rollover — roll fiscal year FY<yyyy> over. Body {"year":"2026"}. Only a steward
+# (409 otherwise), and only for a year with a period (409 otherwise); a year that is not yyyy is 400. Nothing is stored
+# when refused. Makes the next fiscal year's twelve months as the fiscal year generator does (PERIOD_ADDED), adds each
+# person's open figure at the end of the old year's last period (their claims that count belonging to a period of the
+# old year, OPEN or PENDING at its end) to their opening balance for the new year's first period (OPENING_SET), then
+# records ROLLOVER fy=FY<yyyy> periods=<made>. Responds {"made":n}.
